  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0 - Dual Mode Release\n\n⚡ New Features:\n- File-based code generation (similar to Grpc.Tools)\n- Shared code generation library\n- MSBuild tasks for build-time code generation\n- Generated files written to obj directory\n\n🎯 Usage Modes:\n\n1. Source Generator Mode (Default):\n   - In-memory code generation\n   - Full IDE IntelliSense support\n   - Zero build-time overhead\n\n2. File Generation Mode:\n   - Set ProtobufEnableFileGeneration=true\n   - Generated files written to obj/GeneratedProtobuf\n   - Similar to Grpc.Tools workflow\n\n📝 Usage:\n\nDefault (Source Generator):\n1. Add .proto files to project\n2. Build project - code auto-generated\n\nFile Generation Mode:\n1. Add .proto files to project\n2. Add to project file: <ProtobufEnableFileGeneration>true</ProtobufEnableFileGeneration>\n3. Build - files generated in obj/GeneratedProtobuf\n\n💡 Compatibility:\n- .NET 8.0+\n- Visual Studio 2022+\n- JetBrains Rider\n- VS Code with C# extension",
